From 8affac9b705f7af18b603dc1ba793389b72c1590 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: mecattaf <thomas@mecattaf.dev>
Date: Sun, 8 Nov 2026 01:30:43 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] Release native source capture for validated file drags

Consume the matching desktop lifecycle helper through the public process API. Release only the captured pointer of the compositor-confirmed native source, rebind on compositor replacement, and stop owned helpers on cleanup.

Validate all 127 Imagine tests and the pinned bundle, plus actual cross-application drag, SSH image staging and stale-target refusal on the official 63db244 engine.
